 padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A1%9E%E6%A2%85%E5%B0%94%E7%BB%B4%E6%96%AF\" title=\"塞梅尔维斯\"><img alt=\"塞梅尔维斯\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-308801.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308801.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A1%9E%E6%A2%85%E5%B0%94%E7%BB%B4%E6%96%AF\" title=\"塞梅尔维斯\">塞梅尔维斯</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.0</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>21又1</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：308804</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"5\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">追击</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"5\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3088/308804/1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3088/308804/1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3088/308804/2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3088/308804/2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3088/308804/大招 (1).mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3088/308804/大招 (1) - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3088/308804/追击.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3088/308804/追击 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3088/308804/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3088/308804/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">一轮惶惑、不安、善变的月亮，正高悬于天际。<br />她受死神的邀约前来，月光洒在她的身上，如同一层薄而柔软的轻纱。沿着曲折的道路，她将徘徊在那些必死之人的窗边。<br />无论人们如何彷徨，如何恐惧，都无法阻止她的造访，就如同将死之人无法拒绝死神的到来，如同月亮必然迎来圆缺。<br />她的歌声总是比葬礼上的悼歌来得更早，伴随着临终的遗言与忏悔，编织一首又一首独一无二的丧曲。有神秘学研究者猜测这是一种独特、带有仪式性的哀悼礼，又或许与满月令人发狂的神秘学特征有关。而塞梅尔维斯提出了更大胆的设想——“只是一种面对死亡时的彷徨幻觉也说不定？”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"308804\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308807.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/fb/Belonging-308807.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">鎏金红铜手镜<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Gilded Copper Hand Mirror</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />30<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>以四叶草纹和茛苕纹装饰的红色铜制手镜，但比起注视自己的面容，受访者似乎更乐意欣赏位于镜子背面、狞笑着注视众生的怪奇浮雕。<br />“手镜虽华丽，可镜中的虚影太模糊，不如看些更实在的东西。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308808.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/de/Belonging-308808.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">破败头纱<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Ragged Veil</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />350<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>“朦朦胧胧，像笼罩在眼帘前的迷雾，让我想到了‘暴雨’前的维也纳。”<br />受访者一边说着，一边轻轻抬起手臂。灰色的头纱滑落，露出了受访者腕处的金镯。<br />“别被它迷惑。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-308809.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f7/Belonging-308809.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">月相彩绘<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Moon Phase Body Paint</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>绘于受访者脊骨处的月相彩绘，颜料以狼毫、独角兽角、月光鱿墨等神秘学材料制成，完整地记录了月相的变化。<br />“月相的变幻揭示了一个真理，混乱与变化是万物的世界的常态。”<br />而后，受访者转过身去，将彩绘隐藏在了身后。<br />“当然，这种变化从来都不是明面上的。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 心之盈亏1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 心之盈亏2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">心之盈亏 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Wax and Wane of the Heart</small></span></span>"}}